Let's look at the navigation controller logic: On ArrowDown (keyCode 40) they call update(event, list, true, config). update increments currentFocus, then addActive(list) which removes active from all, then sets currentFocus within bounds (wrap), then adds active class and sets aria-selected true, and sets aria-activedescendant to list[currentFocus].id.

